      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho omwoyo gwa Musengwa Katonda gwaidha ku Azaria, mutabane wa Odedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azaria oyo yaaja ewa Asa, yaamukoba ati: “Isebantu kyabazinga, mpulirisa. N'imwe ab'ekika kya Yuda n'ab'ekya Benjamini, mumpulirise. Musengwa Katonda ali ghalala n'imwe, kasita mwena ni muba aghalala naye. Bwe mumunoonia, musobola okumuzuula, aye bwe mumuvaaku, nga yeena abalekulira agho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli baamala ekiseera kinene nga bazira Katonda mwenemwene, era nga bazira kabona ayegeresa, waire okuba n'amateeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bwe baali mu buzibu, baakyukira eri Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa Isiraeli, baamunoonia era baamuzuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biseera ebyo tighaaligho miraala. Ng'omuntu tasobola kutambula n'aja era n'aira nga ghazira kimutuuseeku, kuba ghaaligho obutabanguko kamaala obweraliikirizanga abatyamye boonaboona ab'omu nsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tighaaligho kwegaita: ng'ekiketezo kino kirwanisa kire, ate ekibuga kire kyalwanisa ekindi, kuba Katonda yabatuusa ku kudaazibwadaazibwa yaabaleetera okweraliikirira okutakobeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye imwe mugume bugume, mulobe kuwaamu maani, muligheebwa empeera olw'ebyo bye mukola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa bwe yawulira eby'obulanzi Azaria mutabane wa Odedi bye yayogera, yaafuna amaani. Yaatoola mu kiketezo kya Yuda n'ekya Benjamini, ebintu ebyenhinhalwa ebitali Katonda ebyasinzibwanga. Yaatoolayo n'ebyo ebyali mu bibuga ebyo byonabyona bye yanhaga mu kiketezo kya Efuraimu eky'oku nsozi. Era yaizaagho buyaaka alutaari ya Musengwa Katonda eyali emberi gh'eisinzizo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Asa yaasoloza ab'ekika kya Yuda boonaboona, n'ab'ekya Benjamini. Yaasoloza n'abandi abaabanga aghalala n'abo eyo, abaava mu biketezo bino: ekya Efuraimu, n'ekya Manasse, n'ekya Simeoni kuba abantu kamaala inho baasenguka baava mu biketezo ebyo ebya Isiraeli, baasenga mu bwakyabazinga bwa Asa oyo, nga bamaze okubona Musengwa Katonda we, bw'ali aghalala naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho beesololeza e Yerusalemu, mu mwezi ogwokusatu, mu mwaka ogweikumi n'etaanu, nga kyabazinga Asa oyo n'afuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaghaayo emisengo eri Musengwa Katonda ku lunaku olwo, gino: ente enume lusanvu (700), n'entaama kasanvu (7,000), nga batoola ku munhago gwe baaleeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakola endagaano okusinzanga Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa badhaadha baibwe n'omutima gwaibwe gwonagwona era n'omwoyo gwaibwe gwonagwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era nga kiisi muntu aloba okusinza Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa Isiraeli, omuntu oyo k'abe mukulu oba muto, k'abe musaadha oba mukazi, aba wa kwitibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalayirira Musengwa Katonda nga boogerera ghaigulu n'amaani, era nga bafuuwa amagwala n'endeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boonaboona ab'omu Buyudaaya baasangaalira okulayira okwo, kuba baalayira n'omutima gwaibwe gwonagwona. Era kuba baanoonia Musengwa Katonda n'omwoyo gwaibwe gwonagwona baamuzuula, yaabagha emiraala ku ndhuyi dhaibwe dhoonadhoona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era kyabazinga Asa oyo yaatoola ni ku dhaadha we Maaka ekitiibwa eky'okuba inhina owa kyabazinga, kuba Maaka oyo yakola ekifaananie ekyenhinhalwa ekyasinzibwanga, eky'omusambwa omukazi Ashera. Asa yaatemagho ekifaananie ekyo, yaakimenhamenha, yaakyokera ku kaiga Kiduroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye waire Asa oyo tiyamaliragho irala mu Isiraeli bifo bigulumivu bye baasinzizangamu, obulamu bwe bwonabwona yali mwesigwa ye Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaata mu isinzizo ebintu lata we bye yeeyama okughaayo bibe ebya Musengwa Katonda, era ni mwene bye yeeyama okughaayo, ebya zaabu ni feeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tighaalighooku lutalo kabiri, okutuusa mu mwaka ogwasatu n'etaanu (35) ogw'obufuzi bwa Asa oyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
